                <note rend="inline" type="source">717.2114/53: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Munro</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-10-06T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 6,
                                1927—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>151. Your 260, October 4, 2 p.m. It has been necessary to consult another
                    Department in connection with this question and your instructions have been
                    delayed pending receipt of reply. It is hoped that it may be possible to send
                    instructions to you before long.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
